  "description": "1a. Flux 2 Klein 9B KV FP8 - 1 Image Edit (Same Ratio) is a image utilities workflow designed to inspect, transform, compare, or compose image assets using FLUX.2 Klein 9B. Its 17-node graph exposes 1 prompt/text field(s), 1 media input target(s), and 1 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The ComfyUI editor graph was converted to API format and is ready for live validation against the connected node and model registry.",
